Given a list of phone numbers represented as strings, write a function that checks whether any phone number in the list is a prefix of another phone number in the list. The function should return false if such a prefix relationship exists, and true otherwise. The function name is `check_phone_prefix` and it takes a list of strings as input, returning a boolean. The implementation should have a time complexity of O(n log n). For edge cases, an empty list or a list with a single element should return true, and identical phone numbers are considered prefixes of each other, so they should trigger a false return.

## Tests (your module must pass these)
